      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... everyone says \"rebuild\" or \"find yourself\" but it just feels so exhausting. like trying to build a house on a foundation of nothing. it's just an empty shell. it feels more like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me anymore. sometimes i just sit here and think about how much easier it would be if the silence was just... permanent. if i didn't have to keep pretending to be a person.",
